{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47985","headline":"安凤赠别徐侃 · 徐侃","name":"安凤赠别徐侃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一自离乡国，十年在咸秦。\n泣尽卞和血，不逢一故人。\n今日旧友别，羞此漂泊身。\n离情吟诗处，麻衣掩泪频。\n泪别各分袂，且及来年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐侃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}